 980:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
 981:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_Start                    : Start the CAN module
 982:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_Stop                     : Stop the CAN module
 983:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_RequestSleep             : Request sleep mode entry.
 984:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_WakeUp                   : Wake up from sleep mode.
 985:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_IsSleepActive            : Check is sleep mode is active.
 986:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_AddTxMessage             : Add a message to the Tx mailboxes
 987:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****                                              and activate the corresponding
 988:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****                                              transmission request
 989:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_AbortTxRequest           : Abort transmission request
 990:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_GetTxMailboxesFreeLevel  : Return Tx mailboxes free level
 991:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_IsTxMessagePending       : Check if a transmission request is
 992:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****                                              pending on the selected Tx mailbox
 993:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_GetRxMessage             : Get a CAN frame from the Rx FIFO
 994:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_can.c ****       (+) HAL_CAN_GetRxFifoFillLevel       : Return Rx FIFO fill level
